#: ../../library/stm.rst:4
msgid ":mod:`stm` --- functionality specific to STM32 MCUs"
msgstr "Modul :mod:`stm` --- fungsionalitas khusus untuk MCU STM32"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:9
msgid ""
"This module provides functionality specific to STM32 microcontrollers, "
"including direct access to peripheral registers."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini menyediakan fungsionalitas khusus untuk mikrokontroler STM32, "
"termasuk akses langsung ke register periferal."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:13
msgid "Memory access"
msgstr "Akses memori"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:15
msgid ""
"The module exposes three subscriptable objects used for raw memory access. "
"Each behaves like a sparse array indexed by byte address: ``value = "
"memN[addr]`` reads, ``memN[addr] = value`` writes. The address is always a "
"byte address, regardless of the access width."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini mengekspos tiga objek yang dapat disubskrip yang digunakan untuk "
"akses memori mentah. Masing-masing berperilaku seperti array jarang yang "
"diindeks berdasarkan alamat byte: ``value = memN[addr]`` untuk membaca, "
"``memN[addr] = value`` untuk menulis. Alamat selalu merupakan alamat byte, "
"terlepas dari lebar akses."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:20
msgid ""
"These memory objects can be used in combination with the peripheral register"
" constants below to read and write MCU hardware peripheral registers, as "
"well as any other location in the SoC's address space."
msgstr ""
"Objek memori ini dapat digunakan bersama dengan konstanta register periferal"
" di bawah ini untuk membaca dan menulis register periferal perangkat keras "
"MCU, serta lokasi lain mana pun dalam ruang alamat SoC."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:26
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 8-bit memory accessor. ``mem8[addr]`` reads an ``int`` in the "
"range 0-255 from the byte at ``addr``; ``mem8[addr] = value`` writes the low"
" 8 bits of ``value``. ``addr`` may be any byte-aligned address."
msgstr ""
"Aksessor memori 8-bit yang dapat disubskrip. ``mem8[addr]`` membaca ``int`` "
"dalam rentang 0-255 dari byte di ``addr``\\ ; ``mem8[addr] = value`` menulis"
" 8 bit rendah dari ``value``\\ . ``addr`` dapat berupa alamat byte yang "
"sejajar mana pun."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:32
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 16-bit (halfword) memory accessor. ``mem16[addr]`` reads an "
"``int`` in the range 0-65535; ``mem16[addr] = value`` writes the low 16 "
"bits. ``addr`` must be aligned to 2 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Aksessor memori 16-bit (halfword) yang dapat disubskrip. ``mem16[addr]`` "
"membaca ``int`` dalam rentang 0-65535; ``mem16[addr] = value`` menulis 16 "
"bit rendah. ``addr`` harus sejajar dengan 2 byte."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:38
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 32-bit (word) memory accessor. ``mem32[addr]`` reads an "
"``int`` in the range 0-0xFFFFFFFF; ``mem32[addr] = value`` writes the low 32"
" bits. ``addr`` must be aligned to 4 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Aksessor memori 32-bit (word) yang dapat disubskrip. ``mem32[addr]`` membaca"
" ``int`` dalam rentang 0-0xFFFFFFFF; ``mem32[addr] = value`` menulis 32 bit "
"rendah. ``addr`` harus sejajar dengan 4 byte."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:44
msgid "Peripheral register constants"
msgstr "Konstanta register periferal"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :mod:`stm` module exposes the full set of CMSIS register addresses and "
"offsets for whichever STM32 family the firmware was compiled for. The names "
"mirror ST's CMSIS headers exactly: ``STM32F427xx``, ``STM32F765xx``, "
"``STM32H743xx`` and ``STM32N657xx`` on the M4, M7, H7 family (H7 / H7 Plus /"
" Pure Thermal) and N6 OpenMV Cams respectively. The full set of names is "
"several hundred symbols per family (271 on M4, 306 on M7, 494 on H7, 594 on "
"N6); enumerating them here would simply duplicate ST's reference manual and "
"CMSIS headers."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`stm` mengekspos kumpulan lengkap alamat register CMSIS dan "
"offset untuk keluarga STM32 tempat firmware dikompilasi. Nama-namanya "
"mencerminkan header CMSIS ST secara persis: ``STM32F427xx``\\ , "
"``STM32F765xx``\\ , ``STM32H743xx``\\ , dan ``STM32N657xx`` pada keluarga "
"M4, M7, H7 (H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal) dan OpenMV Cam N6 masing-masing. "
"Kumpulan nama lengkap terdiri dari beberapa ratus simbol per keluarga (271 "
"pada M4, 306 pada M7, 494 pada H7, 594 pada N6); menghitung semuanya di sini"
" hanya akan menduplikasi manual referensi ST dan header CMSIS."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:55
msgid "Two naming conventions are used:"
msgstr "Dua konvensi penamaan digunakan:"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:57
msgid ""
"Constants named after a peripheral instance (``GPIOA``, ``USART1``, "
"``TIM2``, ...) are **absolute base addresses**."
msgstr ""
"Konstanta yang dinamai setelah instans periferal (\\ ``GPIOA``\\ , "
"``USART1``\\ , ``TIM2``\\ , ...) adalah **alamat basis absolut**\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:59
msgid ""
"Constants prefixed with a peripheral type (``GPIO_BSRR``, ``USART_CR1``, "
"``TIM_CCR1``, ...) are **register offsets** relative to the matching base."
msgstr ""
"Konstanta yang diawali dengan tipe periferal (\\ ``GPIO_BSRR``\\ , "
"``USART_CR1``\\ , ``TIM_CCR1``\\ , ...) adalah **offset register** relatif "
"terhadap basis yang sesuai."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:62
msgid ""
"Add an absolute base and a register offset to get the full address of a "
"single register. For example ``stm.GPIOA + stm.GPIO_BSRR`` is the absolute "
"address of ``GPIOA->BSRR``."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan alamat basis absolut dan offset register untuk mendapatkan alamat "
"lengkap dari satu register. Misalnya ``stm.GPIOA + stm.GPIO_BSRR`` adalah "
"alamat absolut dari ``GPIOA->BSRR``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:66
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:77
msgid "Representative constants"
msgstr "Konstanta representatif"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:79
msgid ""
"The selection below covers one entry per major peripheral category, picked "
"so the naming convention is clear at a glance. Every other CMSIS symbol for "
"the build target is also available on the module -- see :func:`__getattr__` "
"below for the type-checker fallback."
msgstr ""
"Seleksi di bawah ini mencakup satu entri per kategori periferal utama, "
"dipilih agar konvensi penamaan jelas sekilas. Setiap simbol CMSIS lain untuk"
" target build juga tersedia di modul -- lihat :func:`__getattr__` di bawah "
"ini untuk fallback pemeriksaan tipe."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:87
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``GPIOA`` peripheral. ``GPIOB`` ... ``GPIOK`` (range "
"depends on the MCU package) follow the same pattern."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis periferal ``GPIOA``\\ . ``GPIOB`` ... ``GPIOK`` (rentang "
"tergantung pada paket MCU) mengikuti pola yang sama."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:93
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``USART1`` peripheral. Other USART / UART instances are "
"exposed under ``USART2``, ``USART3``, ``UART4`` ... as available."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis periferal ``USART1``\\ . Instans USART / UART lainnya diekspos "
"di bawah ``USART2``\\ , ``USART3``\\ , ``UART4`` ... sesuai ketersediaan."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:99
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``SPI1`` peripheral. Additional SPI instances appear as "
"``SPI2``, ``SPI3``, ... up to the MCU's count."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis periferal ``SPI1``\\ . Instans SPI tambahan muncul sebagai "
"``SPI2``\\ , ``SPI3``\\ , ... hingga jumlah MCU."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:105
msgid "Base address of the ``I2C1`` peripheral. ``I2C2`` ... ``I2C4`` follow."
msgstr "Alamat basis periferal ``I2C1``\\ . ``I2C2`` ... ``I2C4`` mengikuti."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:110
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``TIM1`` advanced-control timer. General-purpose and "
"basic timers (``TIM2`` ... ``TIM17`` as available) follow the same naming."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis timer kontrol lanjutan ``TIM1``\\ . Timer tujuan umum dan dasar"
" (\\ ``TIM2`` ... ``TIM17`` sesuai ketersediaan) mengikuti penamaan yang "
"sama."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:116
msgid ""
"Base address of ``ADC1``. ``ADC2`` / ``ADC3`` appear on MCUs with multiple "
"ADC blocks."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis ``ADC1``\\ . ``ADC2`` / ``ADC3`` muncul pada MCU dengan "
"beberapa blok ADC."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:122
msgid "Base address of the DAC peripheral, on MCUs that have one."
msgstr "Alamat basis periferal DAC, pada MCU yang memilikinya."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:127
msgid ""
"Base address of ``DMA1``. ``DMA2`` is present on most STM32s; H7-class parts"
" also expose ``BDMA``, ``MDMA`` and (on the N6) ``HPDMA`` / ``GPDMA``."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis ``DMA1``\\ . ``DMA2`` tersedia pada sebagian besar STM32; "
"komponen kelas H7 juga mengekspos ``BDMA``\\ , ``MDMA``\\ , dan (pada N6) "
"``HPDMA`` / ``GPDMA``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:134
msgid "Base address of the Reset and Clock Control peripheral."
msgstr "Alamat basis periferal Reset dan Clock Control."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:139
msgid "Base address of the External Interrupt / Event Controller."
msgstr "Alamat basis External Interrupt / Event Controller."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:144
msgid ""
"Base address of the embedded flash controller (the peripheral, not the flash"
" array itself)."
msgstr ""
"Alamat basis kontroler flash tertanam (periferal, bukan array flash itu "
"sendiri)."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:150
msgid "Base address of the System Configuration Controller."
msgstr "Alamat basis System Configuration Controller."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:155
msgid "Base address of the Power Control peripheral."
msgstr "Alamat basis periferal Power Control."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:160
msgid "Offset of the GPIO bit set/reset register within any ``GPIOx`` base."
msgstr "Offset register bit set/reset GPIO dalam basis ``GPIOx`` mana pun."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:165
msgid "Offset of the GPIO input data register."
msgstr "Offset register data input GPIO."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:170
msgid "Offset of the GPIO output data register."
msgstr "Offset register data output GPIO."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:175
msgid "Offset of the USART/UART control register 1."
msgstr "Offset register kontrol USART/UART 1."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:180
msgid "Offset of the timer control register 1."
msgstr "Offset register kontrol timer 1."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:185
msgid ""
"Offset of the timer capture/compare register 1. ``TIM_CCR2`` ... "
"``TIM_CCR4`` follow on timers that have multiple channels."
msgstr ""
"Offset register capture/compare timer 1. ``TIM_CCR2`` ... ``TIM_CCR4`` "
"mengikuti pada timer yang memiliki beberapa saluran."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:191
msgid "Offset of the RCC clock control register."
msgstr "Offset register kontrol clock RCC."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:196
msgid "Offset of the RCC clock configuration register."
msgstr "Offset register konfigurasi clock RCC."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:200
msgid ""
"Dynamic-attribute fallback: any CMSIS symbol exposed by the firmware that "
"isn't individually listed above (e.g. ``stm.FDCAN1``, ``stm.OCTOSPI1``, "
"``stm.GPIO_AFR``, the various bit-field shifts and masks, ...) still "
"resolves to its absolute address or offset as an ``int``."
msgstr ""
"Fallback atribut dinamis: simbol CMSIS apa pun yang diekspos oleh firmware "
"yang tidak terdaftar secara individual di atas (misalnya ``stm.FDCAN1``\\ , "
"``stm.OCTOSPI1``\\ , ``stm.GPIO_AFR``\\ , berbagai pergeseran dan mask bit-"
"field, ...) tetap dapat di-resolve ke alamat absolut atau offset-nya sebagai"
" ``int``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:205
msgid ""
"The runtime module populates these symbols directly into its globals dict at"
" import time, so ``__getattr__`` is never actually invoked. The signature is"
" exposed solely so static type checkers (Pyright, Pylance, mypy) accept "
"``stm.<any CMSIS name>`` without a \"module has no attribute\" diagnostic."
msgstr ""
"Modul runtime mengisi simbol-simbol ini langsung ke dalam dict globals-nya "
"saat import, sehingga ``__getattr__`` tidak pernah benar-benar dipanggil. "
"Tanda tangan ini diekspos semata-mata agar pemeriksaan tipe statis (Pyright,"
" Pylance, mypy) menerima ``stm.<any CMSIS name>`` tanpa diagnostik \"modul "
"tidak memiliki atribut\"."
